{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04779","headline":"岳州观竞渡 · 张说","name":"岳州观竞渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画作飞凫艇，双双竞拂流。\n低装山色变，急棹水华浮。\n土尚三闾俗，江传二女游。\n齐歌迎孟姥，独舞送阳侯。\n鼓发南湖溠，标争西驿楼。\n并驱常诧速，非畏日光遒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}